      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "01 / THE SHOT LIST",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "A thought. An angle. Your words on camera.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "FROM THE APP STORE LISTING",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOT 01 · Say it messy",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOT 02 · Shape it into a video",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOT 03 · Pick your hook",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOT 04 · Own the script",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOT 05 · Press record",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "02 / YOUR SCRIPT",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "OPENING",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "One angle. Three hooks.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape This Into a Video gives you one angle and three hooks to choose from.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "MAIN IDEA",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep your voice.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Edit the script, caption and shot plan. The words are yours to change.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "EXAMPLE",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Type it. Say it.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Capture a thought with text or speech.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "TAKEAWAY",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press record.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the teleprompter section by section, or read the full script.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "ENDING",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Come back to it.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep drafts in the on-device Vault and add your own performance notes.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PRICE, PLAINLY · USA",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coach Packs",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Free to download",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "3 Coach Packs per weekly allowance.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Trendi Pro 100 Coach Packs a month.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "$7.99 monthly Renews unless cancelled.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
    {
      "text": "Subscriptions renew unless cancelled in your App Store settings.",
      "source": "WORLDS.md:24–45; INVENTORY.md:62–93"
    },
